          "kicker": "Fixture news",
          "heading": "England A face Bernasconi-led Argentina XV in uncapped Bath clash",
          "body": "England A host Argentina XV in an uncapped match in Bath on Friday, a fixture that gives fringe players from both sides a shot at test call-ups. Argentina head coach Álvaro Galindo, a former Puma, has named a 27-man squad headlined by hooker Bernardo Bernasconi of Benetton, with Harlequins prop Pedro Delgado and Bristol Bears flanker Benjamín Grondona also selected. Both sides play four capped tests in the November Internationals."
        },
