          "kicker": "Referee dispute",
          "heading": "France referee chief Mathieu Raynal challenges World Rugby over hip-drop tackle ban",
          "body": "France's referee chief Mathieu Raynal has challenged World Rugby over the hip-drop tackle ban, according to a fresh report. The row, first reported in October, saw Raynal accuse World Rugby of breaking an agreement as he sought clarity on the new tackle laws. No formal clarification from World Rugby has been reported. Until one arrives, the dispute over the new tackle laws stays unresolved."
        },
