          "kicker": "Opposition squad",
          "heading": "Argentina bring back Facundo Isa for Ireland test, replacing injured Santiago Grondona",
          "body": "Argentina's first Nations Championship squad includes a returning veteran for the visit to Lansdowne Road: Facundo Isa, who missed international duty in 2024 and 2026 and only played for Argentina in July 2025, comes in for the injured Santiago Grondona. Felipe Contepomi's 33-man group has also lost Thomas Gallo, Santiago Carreras and Joaquín Oviedo to injury, and Franco Molina, a regular in recent selections, is absent."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
