      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Russell's future",
          "heading": "Finn Russell has no plans to end Scotland career after World Cup",
          "body": "Finn Russell has confirmed he has no plans to end his Scotland career after the Rugby World Cup in Australia, the first time he has publicly confirmed it. The 34-year-old, who will be 35 by the time the tournament kicks off, has this year and next on his Bath contract and says: 'I'm keen to keep playing.' With New Zealand due at Murrayfield on Saturday, that is a useful signal."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
