      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Injury blow",
          "heading": "Thomas Gallo and Santiago Carreras ruled out of Argentina squad with injuries",
          "body": "Argentina's squad was hit before the London camp had even started. Thomas Gallo (Lyon) and Santiago Carreras (Bath) were lost to injuries on the eve of the three-day London camp in late October, with Mateo Soler (Dogos) and Rodrigo Martínez (Dragons) called up in their places. Centre Santiago Chocobares was awaiting the outcome of a head injury assessment, with Matías Moroni on stand-by. Later coverage lists Gallo and Carreras among players out with long-term injuries."
        },
