          "heading": "Saula Ma'u picked after Tyrel Lomax ruled out with neck issue",
          "body": "Tyrel Lomax has been ruled out of the All Blacks' squad with a neck issue, and Saula Ma'u has been picked after Lomax was ruled out. The Highlander joins Pasilio Tosi as one of the two big tightheads in the 36-man Nations Championship group, and has yet to earn a cap. He is expected to make his Test debut next month, and will look to put himself in the frame for the Rugby World Cup next year."
