          "heading": "Kolbe, Etzebeth, Esterhuizen and Pollard miss touring squad through injury, Hansen says",
          "body": "Cheslin Kolbe, Eben Etzebeth, Andre Esterhuizen and Handré Pollard have all been left out of Rassie Erasmus' touring squad through injury, but Sir Steve Hansen believes the head coach is deliberately managing the group. Speaking on the Rugby Unity podcast, Hansen said Erasmus is giving Etzebeth a breather ahead of the World Cup. Erasmus has included six uncapped players to cover the setbacks, and Hansen believes this will be the final window for experiments before the tournament."
        },
